{"author":{"id":"746a4d30afc20b78119cb8ed7c194f988174fc252f0e9d9eb92022244ef86db3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774464006,"nonce":"r5tw5bE1BgnLtR19qzW8c+mT1YM=","metadata":{"github-id":"I_kwDOK4fCvM72n54-","github-url":"https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/13","origin":"github"},"title":"Create bizzyboat_project11 ROS 2 package","message":"## Summary\n\nCreate a `bizzyboat_project11` ROS 2 package for the BizzyBoat (EchoBoat 240), following the same pattern as `izzyboat_project11`.\n\nPart of #5 (original setup checklist — \"create a ros package similar to izzyboat_project11\").\n\n## Hardware\n\n- **Robot computer**: Neousys Nuvo 9160GC, Core i7-14700, 32 GB RAM (hostname: `gabby`)\n- **GNSS**: CUAV New C-RTK 2HP (dual antenna, centimeter position + heading)\n- **Cameras**: 4× OAK-1 (PoE, connected via TrendNet TI-PG80B switch)\n- **Sonar**: 1× Imagenex DeltaT\n- **Network**: Teltonika RUTX11, MikroTik WiFi bridge, WireGuard VPN\n- **FCU**: ArduPilot via serial (same as IzzyBoat pattern)\n\n## Package Structure\n\n```\nbizzyboat_project11/\n├── package.xml\n├── CMakeLists.txt\n├── launch/\n│   ├── bizzyboat_launch.py       # Main launch (includes echoboat_project11:echo_launch.py)\n│   ├── operator_core_launch.py   # Operator-side launch\n│   └── oak_cameras_launch.py     # 4× OAK camera nodes\n├── config/\n│   ├── platform.yaml             # Dimensions, color, nav sources\n│   ├── bizzyboat.yaml            # UDP bridge, logging, topic config\n│   └── oak*.yaml                 # Per-camera configs\n├── urdf/\n│   └── bizzyboat.urdf            # Sensor frame positions for 240 hull\n└── scripts/\n    └── start_tmux_project11.bash # Startup script for gabby\n```\n\n## Key Differences from IzzyBoat\n\n| Aspect | IzzyBoat (160) | BizzyBoat (240) |\n|--------|---------------|-----------------|\n| Hull | EchoBoat 160 (1.75m × 0.8m) | EchoBoat 240 (larger) |\n| GNSS | PosMV + MAVRos fallback | CUAV C-RTK 2HP (MAVRos only) |\n| Cameras | 1× OAK + 1× USB + JoLo | 4× OAK-1 (PoE) |\n| Sonar | DeltaT + Norbit | DeltaT only |\n| Computer | ? | Nuvo 9160GC (gabby) |\n| Namespace | `izzy` | `bizzy` |\n| Frame prefix | `izzy/` | `bizzy/` |\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Package builds in `platforms_ws`\n- [ ] `bizzyboat_launch.py` launches base echoboat nodes + bizzy-specific sensors\n- [ ] UDP bridge configured with appropriate topics for 4 OAK cameras + DeltaT\n- [ ] URDF with sensor frame positions (can be approximate initially)\n- [ ] Platform dimensions set for EchoBoat 240 hull\n- [ ] Rosbag logging configured for bizzy topics\n- [ ] Network docs in `docs/` reference existing `bizzyboat_network.md`\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.6`","files":null}]}